#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete all the Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "Urifuza koko gusiba ibisubizo byose by'Icyambu kuri MAC kuri IP muri sisitemu?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete the expired Port to MAC to IP results now?"
msgstr "Urifuza koko gusiba ubu ibisubizo by'Icyambu kuri MAC kuri IP byarangiye?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to purge the cached Mactrack scanning functions?"
msgstr "Urifuza koko gusiba burundu imikorere yo gusikana ya Mactrack ibitse mu bubiko bw'agateganyo?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete all the Aggregated Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "Urifuza koko gusiba ibisubizo byose by'Icyambu cyahujwe na MAC na IP muri sisitemu?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete and recreate all the Aggregated Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "Urifuza koko gusiba no kongera gukora ibisubizo byose by'Icyambu cyahujwe na MAC na IP muri sisitemu?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to download and import the IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI database now?"
msgstr "Urifuza koko gukurura no kwinjiza ubu ububiko bw'amakuru ya IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to rebuild the scan date list from the stored Port to MAC to IP results now?"
msgstr "Urifuza koko kongera kubaka urutonde rw'amatariki yo gusikana uhereye ku bisubizo bya Port kuri MAC kuri IP bibitse ubu?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Rebuild and analyze the partition containing the latest port observation, which is the current week with weekly partitions. An unpartitioned table is optimized in full. Scheduled scans are skipped while this runs. Continue?"
msgstr "Kubaka bundi bushya no gusesengura igice kirimo isuzuma rya port riheruka, ari cyo cyumweru cya none mu bice bya buri cyumweru. Imbonerahamwe itagabanyijwemo ibice itunganywa yose uko yakabaye. Isuzuma ryateganijwe rirasimbukwa igihe ibi birimo gukora. Komeza?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Run this maintenance off hours. The rebuild copies the full history of the port (MAC address), IP address and 802.1x tables one after the other and can take hours. Scheduled scans are skipped, database maintenance waits, and MAC, IP and 802.1x searching shows a maintenance message until it finishes. Allow free disk space for a second copy of each table and its indexes. Continue?"
msgstr "Koresha iyi mirimo yo gusana hanze y'amasaha y'akazi. Kongera kubaka bikoporora amateka yuzuye y'imbonerahamwe z'icyambu (aderesi MAC), aderesi IP na 802.1x imwe nyuma y'indi kandi bishobora gufata amasaha. Igenzura ryateguwe rirasimbukwa, isanwa ry'ububiko bw'amakuru rirategereza, kandi gushakisha MAC, IP na 802.1x byerekana ubutumwa bw'isanwa kugeza birangiye. Sigaza umwanya uhagije kuri disiki ku buryo hajyamo kopi ya kabiri ya buri mbonerahamwe n'urutonde rw'ibiyirimo. Komeza?"

