#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Database Administration"
msgstr "Imicungire y'ububiko bw'amakuru"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes expired Port to MAC to IP associations from the database.  Only records that have expired, based upon your criteria are removed."
msgstr "Isiba amahuza ya Port kuri MAC no kuri IP yarangije igihe mu bubiko bw'amakuru. Inyandiko zarangije igihe gusa, ukurikije ibyo washyizeho, ni zo zikurwaho."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Refresh IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI Database"
msgstr "Vugurura Ububikoshingiro bwa MAC/OUI bw'Abatanga bwa IEEE"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "This function will download and install the latest OIU database from the IEEE Website.  Each Network Interface Card (NIC) has a MAC Address.  The MAC Address can be broken into two parts.  The first part of the MAC Address contains the Vendor MAC.  The Vendor MAC identifies who manufactured the part.  This will be helpful in spot checking for rogue devices on your network."
msgstr "Iki gikorwa kizakurura kandi gishyireho ububiko bw'amakuru bwa OIU bugezweho buvuye ku Rubuga rwa IEEE. Buri karita ya Network Interface Card (NIC) igira Aderesi ya MAC. Aderesi ya MAC ishobora gucibwamo ibice bibiri. Igice cya mbere cy'Aderesi ya MAC kiba kirimo MAC y'Uwayikoze. MAC y'Uwayikoze igaragaza uwakoze icyo gice. Ibi bizagufasha mu kugenzura ako kanya ibikoresho bitazwi ku muyoboro wawe."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes old and potentially stale Mactrack scanning functions from the drop-down you receive when you edit a device type."
msgstr "Isiba imikorere ya kera kandi ishobora kuba itagikora y'isuzuma rya Mactrack mu rutonde rumanuka ubona iyo uhindura ubwoko bw'Igikoresho."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes <strong>ALL</strong> Port to MAC to IP associations from the database all IP Addresses, IP Ranges, and VLANS.  This utility is good when you want to start over.  <strong>DANGER: All prior data is deleted.</strong>"
msgstr "Isiba amahuza <strong>YOSE</strong> ya Port kuri MAC no kuri IP mu bubiko bw'amakuru, aderesi za IP zose, ibyiciro bya IP, na VLANS. Iki gikoresho ni cyiza iyo ushaka gutangira bundi bushya. <strong>AKAGA: Amakuru yose yabanje arasibwa.</strong>"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Rebuilds the list of scan dates from the stored Port to MAC to IP results, reading each partition once. Scans and maintenance keep the list current, so this is only needed after results were removed outside of maintenance, for example by deleting devices."
msgstr "Yubaka bundi bushya urutonde rw'amatariki y'isuzuma ivuye mu bisubizo byabitswe bya Port kuri MAC kuri IP, isoma buri gice rimwe. Isuzuma n'isana bituma urutonde ruhuza n'igihe, bityo ibi bikenerwa gusa nyuma y'uko ibisubizo byavanyweho hanze y'isana, urugero nko gusiba ibikoresho."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "View Partition Status"
msgstr "Reba imiterere y'ibice by'ububiko"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Shows how the Port to MAC to IP results are partitioned, the partition size in use and why, and what the last database maintenance did."
msgstr "Byerekana uko ibisubizo bya Port kuri MAC kuri IP bigabanyijwe mu bice, ingano y'igice ikoreshwa n'impamvu yayo, ndetse n'icyo isuzumwa n'isanwa rya nyuma ry'ububiko bw'amakuru ryakoze."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Rebuilds and analyzes only the partition containing the latest port observation to reclaim deleted space; with weekly partitions that is the current week. Unpartitioned tables are optimized in full. Scheduled scans are skipped until it finishes."
msgstr "Yubaka bundi bushya kandi igasesengura gusa igice kirimo isuzuma rya port riheruka kugira ngo igarure umwanya wasibwe; mu bice bya buri cyumweru ni icyumweru cya none. Imbonerahamwe zitagabanyijwemo ibice zitunganywa zose uko zakabaye. Isuzuma ryateganijwe rirasimbukwa kugeza birangiye."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Choose daily or weekly partitions, or disable partitioning, for the port (MAC address), IP address and 802.1x tables. The rebuild copies the full history in the background; scheduled scans are skipped and MAC, IP and 802.1x searching shows a maintenance message meanwhile."
msgstr "Hitamo ibice bya buri munsi cyangwa bya buri cyumweru, cyangwa uhagarike kugabanyamo ibice, ku mbonerahamwe z'icyambu (aderesi ya MAC), aderesi ya IP na 802.1x. Kongera kubaka gukoporora amateka yose mu nyuma; isaka riteganyijwe rirasimbukwa kandi gushakisha MAC, IP na 802.1x bigaragaza ubutumwa bwo gusana muri icyo gihe."

