#: setup.php
msgid "Switch/Hub, Switch/Router Settings"
msgstr "Amagenamiterere ya Switch/Hub, Switch/Router"

#: setup.php
msgid "Provide a list of ports on a specific switch/hub whose MAC results should be ignored.  Ports such as link/trunk ports that can not be distinguished from other user ports are examples.  Each port number must be separated by a colon, pipe, or a space ':', '|', ' '.  For example, 'Fa0/1: Fa1/23' or 'Fa0/1 Fa1/23' would be acceptable for some manufacturers switch types."
msgstr "Tanga urutonde rw'ibyambu ku gikoresho cya switch/hub runaka aho ibisubizo bya MAC bigomba kwirengagizwa. Ibyambu nk'ibya link/trunk bidashobora gutandukanywa n'ibindi byambu by'abakoresha ni ingero. Buri nimero y'icyambu igomba gutandukanywa na colon, pipe, cyangwa umwanya ':', '|', ' '. Urugero, 'Fa0/1: Fa1/23' cyangwa 'Fa0/1 Fa1/23' byakwemerwa ku bwoko bumwe na bumwe bwa switch z'abakora ibikoresho."

#: setup.php
msgid "You can use specific SNMP settings or select SNMP set. In the second case, mactrack tries to find correct settings from SNMP set"
msgstr "Ushobora gukoresha amagenamiterere ya SNMP yihariye cyangwa ugahitamo itsinda rya SNMP. Mu buryo bwa kabiri, mactrack igerageza gushaka amagenamiterere nyayo mu itsinda rya SNMP"

